---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About · Token Cost Index">
  <section class="max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="text-figure m-0 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
      About
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed">
      Nobody can tell you what API-based AI will cost before you build it. This
      index collects real, measured token costs for specific business tasks so
      finance and ops teams can put a defensible number on a business case.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed">
      Open data, closed write path. Anyone can read, query, and export the
      dataset. Submissions go through a validated form and a moderation queue.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
      Full quality rules, licensing, and moderation detail arrive with Phase 5.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
